{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "3aa36993608fe67075bf1975da419b4cf73e4bae311a6a9b987b9d700f4f9fff", "ja": "コレってまさか……アレ？", "zh": "这难不成……是那个？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "4434bf48db15234dfe4ee22d369c26e459b06c7b12eba044018012911b5ad15d", "ja": "アイドルに関する記憶だけが失われたまつり\nを、心配する一同。まつり本人は、小さい頃\nから憧れていたアイドルになれて、不思議な\n気分と言う。こうしてユニット『タウラス』\nは、奇妙な滑り出しを見せるのだった。", "zh": "众人都在担心失去了与偶像有关记忆的庆典。庆典本人说，自己终于成为了从小就憧憬的偶像，感觉很不可思议。就这样，名为『Taurus』的组合展现出了奇妙的开端。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ca2cc78ebdbe56b60f14726d888a3e24771e8c7a7776c163d85d1a9909e214a1", "ja": "（ミーティングは終わったが、誰も帰ろうとしない。\n美也も未来も、まつりの様子が気になるようだ……）", "zh": "（会议结束了，但谁也没有要回去的意思。看来美也和未来都很在意祭的情况……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_02_1001_014mir", "source_sha256": "03703679456f7f009c4bedc441770b7702c2a1b4e725736b824379be27a6b953", "ja": "今日のまつりちゃん、なんかいつもと違う……？\nどうしちゃったの？", "zh": "今天的小祭，总觉得和往常不太一样……？\n这是怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_02_1002_021mat", "source_sha256": "31ed46800bd6a92bfaa8c7cbfac64810a77aff0f8cb1a4f6eff7766e5b6cadd3", "ja": "えっと……私、そんなに変かな？", "zh": "那个……我真的有那么奇怪吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_02_1003_014mir", "source_sha256": "8830e2af3931283e2af24ba7d31a6f5aa72c2c442a2fd7110f4214c0cf869cf4", "ja": "うーん。変っていえば変だけど、\n見た感じは、いつもと変わらないかも……？", "zh": "嗯——要说奇怪的话，确实有点奇怪，不过看起来可能和往常没什么不同……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_02_1004_042miy", "source_sha256": "81c93f523926280cd7d562841992b5de0842fadead284ea8c57861109ab11ccf", "ja": "まつりちゃん、何かあったんですか～？", "zh": "小茉莉，是发生什么事了吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_02_1005_021mat", "source_sha256": "0e83a3453421bb6145cd1d2d06b9c5ee456194b00f138296d7794d9c2030fb24", "ja": "うん……ここに来る前、頭に何か当たった気がする。\nでも、あんまり覚えてなくて……。", "zh": "嗯……在来这里之前，总觉得头上好像被什么东西砸到了。\n不过，记不太清楚了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_02_1006_p", "source_sha256": "7f6106cf8dd073ff527d825a3091b487212dfb6aa26cd98edb5b6898c1dc3aef", "ja": "えっ！？　頭にって……まつり、大丈夫か？\nケガはしてないのか？", "zh": "欸！？你说头上……小祭，你没事吧？\n有没有受伤？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_02_1007_014mir", "source_sha256": "4c48a1ac83acd157b2e75c0abdb86e3c2ea4fd5ecc9690c1e0839f73ef195c93", "ja": "そうだよ！　まつりちゃん、大丈夫なの！？", "zh": "对呀！祭，没事吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_02_1008_021mat", "source_sha256": "ebb6ad2678e2d6e2dd8148c40c184a8242bc9304e45918611f128c9397d0662c", "ja": "うん、大丈夫。ケガはしてないみたい。\n突然だったから、ちょっとびっくりしたけど……。", "zh": "嗯，没事。好像没有受伤。\n因为发生得太突然，稍微吓了一跳……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_02_1009_p", "source_sha256": "9f0779f9a8bc343c102e2dac13e09c6a35ed58563bd8409785fe4985b7e8cae1", "ja": "（もしかして……美也の言っていた隕石が！？）", "zh": "（难道是……美也之前说的那颗陨石！？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_02_1010_p", "source_sha256": "ad79406bc68a92cd48a045046d456ac2fd8420143660c601a3f4b8b956ba92aa", "ja": "まつり、その時の事は覚えてるか？\n何が当たったとか……。", "zh": "茉莉，你还记得当时的事情吗？\n比如被什么砸到了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_02_1011_021mat", "source_sha256": "cf2f81a2ad1481f881c8b6b91b3e467db40e6a9557b761731832618bef02cd49", "ja": "えっ？　うーん……なんだろう？\nお星さま……うん、多分、お星さまだと思う。", "zh": "咦？嗯……是什么来着？\n星星……嗯，我想大概是星星吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_02_1012_042miy", "source_sha256": "8678bba69721f48d6ec8bc80c4a4f3c86fde683f424ee7ba7c42deaacff27d23", "ja": "なんと～、お星さまが当たったんですか～？\nもしや、『メー』に載っていた、隕石でしょうか……。", "zh": "哎呀～，是星星撞到你了吗～？\n难道是刊登在《メー》上的那颗陨石吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_02_1013_021mat", "source_sha256": "1d4c5e8d37bb472e3173fbf8e08620510afdbb0c686d49c962909201d0a63ebb", "ja": "みんな、優しいんだね……心配してくれてありがとう。\n……そうだ。みんなのこと、もっと教えてほしいな。", "zh": "大家都很温柔呢……谢谢你们为我担心。\n……对了，我想多了解一些大家的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_02_1014_014mir", "source_sha256": "2ee4c8e4992b3604c46436a6b8cd5bf5437b831c72237d3da2ebeca18c0f049b", "ja": "うん、全然いいよー！　なんでも教えてあげる！", "zh": "嗯，当然没问题啦！想知道什么我都告诉你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_02_1015_042miy", "source_sha256": "c4d495d8e05a0338e460530823b370f112eca8adf3117d71d699cf14a542a524", "ja": "はい～。聞きたいことがあれば、\nなんでも聞いてくださいね～。", "zh": "好的～如果有什么想问的，\n尽管问我吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_02_1016_021mat", "source_sha256": "e956a6fe7e8ae33325a6a3b82effa92006d29edceb1039d09db71638981c3934", "ja": "それじゃ、さっそくだけど……みんなが今、\n一番楽しみにしてることは何？", "zh": "那么，马上进入正题……大家现在最期待的事情是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_02_1017_014mir", "source_sha256": "ef5b6dd47257fd005ef28bcfdffe8292843b5ee9ac4db2adfbf17a6ae3282aab", "ja": "私はね、天体公演！　あとは……このユニットで、\nまつりちゃんと美也ちゃんと、もっと仲良くなりたい！", "zh": "我最期待天文演出！还有……我想在这个组合里，和小茉莉、小美也变得更加要好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_02_1018_042miy", "source_sha256": "fae3d9e532cbd242d49ac1749a9bef90daaae7666f8541eb4814cd8cc2d0480b", "ja": "私もですよ～。同じユニットになったんですから、\nふたりのこと、たくさん知りたいです～。", "zh": "我也是哦～。既然成为了同一个组合，我想多多了解你们两个～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_02_1019_p", "source_sha256": "4d1e92f120988b28e4db899930935c4a19221219a6b783852a11577e1c1dd87b", "ja": "3人とも、ポジティブだな……。\nまつり、逆に覚えている事はあるのか？", "zh": "你们3个还真乐观啊……\n茉莉，那你反过来还记得些什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_02_1020_021mat", "source_sha256": "b4424a02abbc406a31391bdf13d63eb470e11b1a262abe607776b2fb4449c02e", "ja": "覚えてること？　えっと……\nお家のこととか、学校のことは覚えてるけど……。", "zh": "记得的事？嗯……家里的事啊、学校的事还记得……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_02_1021_p", "source_sha256": "a6a4f74543ee1de0b9914f3bf69e7a056b63d4e0c346ad70a9d9ff841be4c4ef", "ja": "そうか……ひょっとしたら、劇場やアイドル活動の\n記憶だけが、抜け落ちてるのかもな。", "zh": "这样啊……说不定，只有剧场和偶像活动的记忆缺失了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_02_1022_014mir", "source_sha256": "b58d6acb52a882d68020f1a5946d1dfc6930e89342204ab45bc4d8249a7f80c3", "ja": "あっ！　コレって、アレですよね？\nえっと……アレってなんだっけ？", "zh": "啊！这个，是那个对吧？\n呃……那个叫什么来着？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_02_1023_042miy", "source_sha256": "9ff41ff3fcbc6cba581e377ff33e4b73aff2dad307b52b3944afc50fd0e4a66e", "ja": "もしかして、記憶喪失のことでしょうか～？", "zh": "难道说，指的是失忆吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_02_1024_014mir", "source_sha256": "50d9388a66d9a33ad03f42ffa9334166fa09678bdddb0e954186211075827582", "ja": "あ、それ！　記憶そーしつ！", "zh": "啊，就是那个！失忆！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_02_1025_021mat", "source_sha256": "a34729688c4581d07a88dd7c57640db24a7199144edd739f5b90e7f21a81515d", "ja": "もし、みんなの言うとおり、記憶喪失だったとしても\n……私がアイドルだなんて、なんだか信じられないな。", "zh": "就算真像大家说的，我是失忆了……\n可说我是偶像什么的，总觉得有点难以置信呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_02_1026_p", "source_sha256": "269873d2e4a2dce1159d654fa1ea7c9e88f083be3e0bc589d34da17986605894", "ja": "まつり？", "zh": "茉莉？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_02_1027_021mat", "source_sha256": "171ec77765700aba3bb196e0d97daefbe53d6c4fd5f242c8f042bc2450469621", "ja": "私、小さい頃から、アイドルになりたかったんだ。\nだから、急にアイドルって言われて……不思議な気分。", "zh": "我啊，从小就想成为偶像。\n所以，突然被说要当偶像……感觉好奇妙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_02_1028_021mat", "source_sha256": "c283295df21c62cb99b98832827073c813945cb2f0351aa1f40b2666d4d27e1b", "ja": "夢がいきなり叶っちゃって、ドキドキしてる。\nルルル……♪って、歌い出しちゃいそうなくらいだよ。", "zh": "梦想突然成真了，让我好心动呢。\n甚至都想忍不住唱起“噜噜噜……♪”了哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_02_1029_014mir", "source_sha256": "730dc1ed00e002b2c15da774dbce24e001fc118088963ba1ba95a25dbd4cb9e5", "ja": "ルルル……それって、まつりちゃんの歌？", "zh": "啦啦啦……那是小祭的歌吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_02_1030_021mat", "source_sha256": "8f036d48173b3082b50a9362e285129f8ea4e43c74935e1c4156697fb69254be", "ja": "うん。よく覚えてないけど、浮かんできたの。\nもしかして、私が口ずさんでたりしたのかな？", "zh": "嗯。虽然记不太清了，但突然就想到了。\n难道是我之前哼唱过吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_02_1031_042miy", "source_sha256": "4fe3bd4d966daf01b45cee1ff61bb13c95b9a98a7f04437e35e3846c8bc56723", "ja": "ルルル……♪　なるほど～。\n口ずさむと、楽しくなってきますね～。", "zh": "啦啦啦……♪ 原来如此～  \n哼着哼着，就会觉得开心起来呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_02_1032_p", "source_sha256": "3d3b54b90940f10ed62c7fb62b5884dd4ef3072fb9bc9ca644efb4c88587f957", "ja": "そうだな……もしかしたら、そのメロディが\nきっかけで、何か思い出せるかもしれない。", "zh": "是啊……说不定能以那段旋律为契机，想起些什么。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_02_1033_p", "source_sha256": "aa834987401a5742b029b7f522ae9cffca578e102fb95913ddba59b407716d22", "ja": "幸い、次の天体公演までまだ時間はある、\nみんなで考えていこう。", "zh": "幸好离下次天体公演还有时间，\n我们大家一起来慢慢想吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
